{ @@HeaderStart@@Discovered Attack@@HeaderEnd@@  A discovered attack is a form of double attack where one piece moves to attack another, unmasking an attack by a second piece. }
1. Nd4
{ In the above position, the knight can jump to d4, unleashing an attack on the black queen. Black is forced to choose the lesser of two evils, and accept the loss of the bishop on f5.   As always, things do not necessarily work out as we plan, and we must always check carefully that our opponent does not surprise us with an 'acrobatic' defence. }
*

