{ Here Black resigned ! } 1... Qg4
{ White has just sacrificed the queen on f6 and Black resigned ! BUT...   would have won the game   1...gxf6?  2.Rg3+  Kh8  3.Bxf6# }
2. hxg4 gxf6
{ and the g file is not accessible for White, who is simply a rook down } *

