{ Another premature resignation. } 1. Ne3
{ Seeing mate on f1 or e1, White threw in the towel, Jonasson-Angantysson 0-1, BUT results in f1 being protected by the queen   1.Kh1??  exf1=Q# }
1... Bxe3+ 2. Kh1 exf1=Q+ 3. Qxf1 { with a decisive advantage } *

