{ White regretted resigning. } 1. Rd6
{ White resigned at this point in the game Torre-NN played in a simultaneous exhibition in 1924. In fact, Torre could have won by playing   1.f7??  Rc1+  2.Ke2  d1=Q+ }
1... Rxd6
{ 1...cxd6  now the pawn on d2 is no longer a threat  2.f7  and wins } 2. g8=Q+
Kd7 { 2...Rd8  3.Qxd8+  Kxd8  4.f7 } 3. Qxh7+ Kc6 4. Qe4+ Kb6 5. Qb4+ Kc6 6.
Qxc5+ Kxc5 7. f7 { and wins } *

