{ @@HeaderStart@@The Missing Piece!@@HeaderEnd@@  In these valuable exercises you have to place a piece on the board so as to create checkmate or a winning position. These exercises are more than just good fun; they improve pattern recognition, visualisation and creativity as well.  A note from Chessable: Since these exercises do not follow a standard chess tactic protocol we were unable to make them interactive. They are included here for those of you who are interested in missing piece exercises. }
